* Auto-generated testbench for inrush analysis: U2 (switching)
* Output: 5.058V, 46.3µF total capacitance
* Soft-start: 1.0ms ramp

* Voltage source with linear ramp (soft-start) — 10us delay before ramp
Vreg ramp 0 PWL(0 0 10u 0 1.01m 5.058)
* Regulator output impedance; 0 V source in series measures the current
Rout ramp sense 10m
Vsense sense out DC 0

* Output capacitors
C2 out 0 22u
C3 out 0 22u
C104 out 0 100n
C105 out 0 2.2u

.control
tran 2u 3m
let i_out = abs(i(Vsense))
let i_peak = vecmax(i_out)
let i_tgt = i_peak * 0.999
meas tran t_peak when i_out=i_tgt rise=1
meas tran v_settled find v(out) at=2.7m
echo "i_peak=$&i_peak t_peak=$&t_peak v_settled=$&v_settled v_target=5.058 r_out=0.01" > inrush_idx0.out
quit
.endc

.end
